  "goodToKnow": "Der Aufruhr is uproar, turmoil or riot: in Aufruhr geraten, die Stadt in Aufruhr versetzen, innerer Aufruhr (emotional turmoil). Historically, it meant rebellion against authority, and der Aufrührer is an agitator. It's related to rühren (to stir), not directly Ruhe, though the sense is the opposite of calm. Synonyms: der Tumult, die Unruhe. Plural (rare): die Aufruhre."
